# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 协作时产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary

# 自托管的 Sveltia CMS 主程序是压缩产物，按文本处理会拖慢 diff，标记为二进制更合适
public/admin/sveltia-cms.js binary
